From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vylen Linux Team
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] clc: do not require libclc.pc

libclc 23 and newer no longer install libclc.pc. Mesa only needs the
libexecdir variable from that file in order to locate the libclc resource
files, so represent the dependency directly with a Meson declared dependency.

This keeps the existing dep_clc interface used by src/compiler/clc/meson.build
without invoking pkg-config.

---
 meson.build | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -3,4 +3,6 @@
 dep_clc = null_dep
 if with_clc
-  dep_clc = dependency('libclc')
+  dep_clc = declare_dependency(
+    variables : {'libexecdir': join_paths(get_option('prefix'), get_option('datadir'), 'clc')},
+  )
 endif
